OL,3,GNEWSAMan who nearly died during liver  
OL,4,Asurgery at Aberdeen hospital says      
OL,5,Amistakes were made                     
OL,7,FA man who almost died during liver     
OL,8,Fsurgery at Aberdeen Royal Infirmary    
OL,9,F(ARI) has told BBC Scotland News he    
OL,10,Fbelieves mistakes were made during his 
OL,11,Foperation.                             
OL,13,FDerek Appleton, from Stockport, was    
OL,14,Fliving in Orkney when he underwent     
OL,15,Fsurgery to remove 60% of his liver     
OL,16,Fafter being diagnosed with stage four  
OL,17,Fcancer.                                
OL,19,FThe 60-year-old lost 11 litres of blood
OL,20,Fand went into cardiac arrest, but says 
OL,21,Fhe has never been given a proper       
OL,22,Fexplanation for what happened.         
