OL,3,GNEWSAMan who nearly died during liver  
OL,4,Asurgery at Aberdeen hospital says      
OL,5,Amistakes were made                     
OL,7,FIt comes after a leaked review of 45   
OL,8,Fpatients who died following liver and  
OL,9,Fpancreatic surgery at the hospital     
OL,10,Ffound that 19 of those deaths could    
OL,11,Fhave been avoided.                     
